# Build context of the two images built from the repository root: Dockerfile (the bot build
# image: sdk/ and tools/build.sh) and deploy/Dockerfile.ladder (service/, engine.lock and the
# kfm_arena fetch script). Everything else stays out; keep the context small.
*
!sdk/
!tools/build.sh
!service/
service/target/
!engine.lock
!tools/lock.sh
!tools/fetch_kfm_arena.sh
